        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Ps Cn for 26" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="624" ed="#liebermann"/>Episcopi, abbates et barones mei non calumniabuntur pro uenatione, si non regales feras occiderint; et si regales, restabunt rei regi pro libito suo, sine certa emendatione.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 624 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
